      "id": "495f8bf6-9e7c-4e80-a050-6940d617c0da",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "//单链表\r\nclass ListNode {\r\n    int val;\r\n    ListNode next;\r\n    ListNode(int x) { val = x; }\r\n}\r\n\r\n// 输入一个数组，转换为一条单链表\r\nListNode createLinkedList(int[] arr) {\r\n    if (arr == null || arr.length == 0) {\r\n        return null;\r\n    }\r\n    ListNode head = new ListNode(arr[0]);\r\n    ListNode cur = head;\r\n    for (int i = 1; i < arr.length; i++) {\r\n        cur.next = new ListNode(arr[i]);\r\n        cur = cur.next;\r\n    }\r\n    return head;\r\n}",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "java",
        "id": "495f8bf6-9e7c-4e80-a050-6940d617c0da",
